Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:26.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}孟菲尔斯 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 巴列霍 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Gaël, the show goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,加埃尔 好戏还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Here in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,What a performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,多精彩的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What a match. You're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,多精彩的一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the second round,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你晋级第二轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:13.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and you've done it in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且赢得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Good evening, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,晚上好 纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,that was that was definitely very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的 真的很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:27.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Play the day of my 40th birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,在四十岁生日这天打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,is a special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys made it like incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们让这一切好得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:37.24,EN,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:42.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 这个庆祝方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to celebrate your 40th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,来过你的四十岁生日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:13.48,EN,,0,0,0,,This is your 18th US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你第十八次打美网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,you're through to the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你晋级第二轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,How You have a special relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和这里的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.16,EN,,0,0,0,,with the crowd here in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一种特别的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.16,0:01:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,How special is it for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你来说有多特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to play another match here in New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在纽约再打一场球？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, it's it's very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 这非常特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys always make it like you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们总能让这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,know, electric, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,像通了电一样 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的气氛难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel great here, and always you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这里感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I try to put great tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想打出好网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but a great show, and you guys are rock,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,也想给一场好表演 你们最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,so let's keep it up for the second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二轮我们继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And just finally, Gaël,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题 加埃尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,we've already spoken
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们已经聊过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,about it being your 40th birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天是你的四十岁生日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so happy birthday again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,再祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Your wife, Elina, is of course watching
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你太太斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然就在看台上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys have already played mixed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们俩已经一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,doubles together, but I wanted to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,打过混双了 但我想问
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:06.92,EN,,0,0,0,,has she got your birthday present yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,她送你生日礼物了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:10.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And if so, can you reveal to us what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,送了的话 能说说是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Actually, I mean I think she's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实 我想她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,playing tomorrow, so it's great effort
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天还有比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.56,EN,,0,0,0,,for her to to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,能留下来对她很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 是的 她送了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,It was an amazing gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一份很棒的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,If she allowed me to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果她允许我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,she she offered me a great watch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,她送了我一块很棒的表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.20,EN,,0,0,0,,for my 40th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,为我的四十岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.86,EN,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
